# Finance SaaS Backend

A secure, multi-tenant financial management backend for small businesses.

The application is designed to help small businesses track their income, expenses, cash flow, and financial documents. Users will be able to manually record transactions or upload invoices and receipts, which can be processed using AI to extract financial information and suggest transaction categories.

## Project Status

🚧 **Currently in development**

This project is being developed incrementally, starting with the backend foundation, authentication, multi-tenancy, and transaction management.

---

## Core Features

### Authentication & Security

* User registration and login
* Secure password hashing with `bcryptjs`
* JWT-based authentication
* Access and refresh token architecture
* Role-based authorization
* Request validation
* Rate limiting
* Security headers
* Multi-tenant data isolation

### Financial Management

* Income management
* Expense management
* Transaction categories
* Cash flow tracking
* Account/balance tracking
* Transaction history
* Search and filtering
* Pagination

### AI-Powered Document Processing

* Upload invoices and receipts
* PDF and image processing
* AI-based data extraction
* Automatic income/expense detection
* Automatic category suggestions
* Transaction draft generation
* User review and confirmation before saving

### Reports & Analytics

* Income reports
* Expense reports
* Cash flow reports
* Category-based expense analysis
* Monthly financial summaries
* Dashboard statistics

